  "historyNote": "#9121, eff 4-3-08, EXPIRED: 4-3-16 New. #12047, INTERIM, eff 11-19-16, EXPIRED: 5-18-17 New. #12414, eff 11-3-17 (from He-P 804.24); ss by #13339, eff 1-29-22",
